to consumers and businesses and provides internet-delivered cloud-based services to consumers and businesses including cybersecurity, privacy, and marketing technology.","section":"Item 2.Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations","block":452,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001084048-26-000046","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-07","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001084048","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1084048/000108404826000046/zd-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/090b6419e0acbde07cef5dc6006fc6774b1126f2f63b06791779d2a7c5b0b463.bin","sha256":"090b6419e0acbde07cef5dc6006fc6774b1126f2f63b06791779d2a7c5b0b463"}},{"id":"8a5618ca98e37d41436428877de783056a4ebd0893f9024426a61a82fa9283b7","quote":"(2) Excludes customers that generated less than $2,500 in the quarter and those of certain newly acquired businesses.","context":"(1) Net advertising and performance marketing revenue retention equals (i) the trailing twelve months revenues recognized related to prior year customers in the current year period (excluding revenues from acquisitions during the stub period) divided by (ii) the trailing twelve months revenues recognized related to prior year customers in the prior year period (excluding revenues from acquisitions during the stub period). This excludes customers that generated less than $10,000 of revenues in the measurement period.","section":"Performance Metrics","block":468,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001084048-26-000046","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-07","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001084048","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1084048/000108404826000046/zd-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/090b6419e0acbde07cef5dc6006fc6774b1126f2f63b06791779d2a7c5b0b463.bin","sha256":"090b6419e0acbde0